WEBVTT

00:12.190 --> 00:14.310
Okay, let's go look for her.

00:14.310 --> 00:15.240
Yeah!

00:26.450 --> 00:31.260
Seventy and two gods
reside in the pillars.

00:31.680 --> 00:35.800
Their names and forms are diverse.

00:37.010 --> 00:40.480
Among those called good, there is evil.

00:41.230 --> 00:45.220
Among those called evil, there is good.

02:11.540 --> 02:15.970
I'll Definitely Revive You!

02:29.170 --> 02:33.100
Let's restore this place to the
beautiful spring it once was.

02:33.100 --> 02:33.920
Yeah.

02:33.920 --> 02:35.750
We won't lose this time.

02:36.130 --> 02:37.880
Let's go, everyone.

02:37.880 --> 02:38.970
Yeah.

02:45.650 --> 02:47.730
What? Come on!

02:55.220 --> 02:56.360
Toripu!

02:57.420 --> 02:59.490
Fire, go!

03:12.630 --> 03:15.240
I can't believe the Toripu
have spread this far.

03:24.680 --> 03:25.910
It's the Lucasite.

03:26.320 --> 03:27.810
How horrible.

03:28.230 --> 03:31.380
The temple's barrier
seems to have weakened.

03:31.380 --> 03:33.560
Could something have happened to Heqet?

03:33.940 --> 03:35.190
We've got to defeat it.

03:50.350 --> 03:54.710
Prominence, show yourself
here and obey me.

03:55.210 --> 03:56.030
Go!

04:12.710 --> 04:14.500
I wonder if there's any.

04:14.500 --> 04:16.560
I wonder if there's any water.

04:18.640 --> 04:20.280
I smell water.

04:20.920 --> 04:22.010
Ragon?

04:22.010 --> 04:23.130
Wait!

04:32.320 --> 04:33.330
Ragon!

04:33.330 --> 04:34.810
Ouch...

04:34.810 --> 04:37.340
Hey, Ragon!

04:37.340 --> 04:38.840
Are you okay?

04:39.310 --> 04:42.840
Yeah. I just got a little scrape.

04:50.550 --> 04:51.960
Ouch...

04:53.280 --> 04:55.440
Are you two okay?

04:57.330 --> 04:58.820
Who am I?

04:58.820 --> 04:59.540
Rudra.

04:59.540 --> 05:00.370
Metal?

05:00.370 --> 05:01.230
Ragon!

05:01.230 --> 05:02.930
You're bleeding.

05:02.930 --> 05:03.520
Huh?

05:03.520 --> 05:04.450
So are you.

05:04.450 --> 05:05.360
What?

05:08.690 --> 05:13.610
What am I going to do?! I'm dying...

05:14.460 --> 05:15.660
You seem all right.

05:15.660 --> 05:16.450
Oh, good.

05:16.450 --> 05:17.960
Hey, look at that.

05:18.880 --> 05:19.980
A frog?

05:19.980 --> 05:21.270
It's a frog.

05:22.170 --> 05:23.920
But his eyes fell out.

05:23.920 --> 05:24.970
Yeah, they did.

05:25.500 --> 05:27.680
Should we put them back?

05:27.680 --> 05:29.080
Yeah, let's do it.

05:29.080 --> 05:30.970
The frog will be happy.

05:56.450 --> 05:58.350
He doesn't seem very happy.

05:58.350 --> 06:00.030
Maybe he's not happy.

06:00.030 --> 06:01.670
What a weird face.

06:08.000 --> 06:09.550
I smell water.

06:13.180 --> 06:14.370
It's water!

06:14.370 --> 06:15.810
There's water!

06:16.380 --> 06:18.890
This water will give Kero-chan energy.

06:18.890 --> 06:19.790
Yeah, it will.

06:19.790 --> 06:20.810
Let's gather some.

06:20.810 --> 06:21.820
Yeah!

06:22.290 --> 06:23.730
Let's take a lot with us!

06:30.570 --> 06:31.660
All right.

06:32.220 --> 06:34.410
That's all of them. All that remains...

07:27.180 --> 07:30.030
Huh? Leviatan, you haven't changed.

07:30.030 --> 07:32.210
Even though you evolved, you're just
the same as you've always been.

07:32.210 --> 07:34.220
What? That's not possible...

07:34.220 --> 07:38.010
It's not her appearance,
but her magic! I'm sure of it.

07:38.010 --> 07:41.320
We'll know once she starts
fighting! Probably...

07:41.320 --> 07:42.060
Got it.

07:47.380 --> 07:49.570
We need to suppress the
Lucasite's actions.

07:49.570 --> 07:50.490
I'll give it a shot.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.910
Water, come.

07:56.080 --> 07:56.890
Go!

08:03.580 --> 08:04.630
Nice!

08:04.630 --> 08:05.420
All right!

08:06.340 --> 08:08.000
Fire, go!

08:11.300 --> 08:12.130
Watch out!

08:12.570 --> 08:16.010
If you dart around down there,
you'll get in the way of my magic.

08:16.430 --> 08:18.560
You're so mean!
Can't you aim properly?!

08:18.560 --> 08:19.700
I can't help it!

08:19.700 --> 08:21.640
I'm aiming for him, but sometimes I miss.

08:21.950 --> 08:24.690
Quit arguing and defeat him.

08:37.980 --> 08:40.290
Oh, no! The barrier disappeared!

08:40.290 --> 08:41.160
What?

08:50.570 --> 08:52.670
Stop moving around!

08:56.060 --> 08:58.260
Don't destroy the temple!

09:00.850 --> 09:03.100
Sorry, it wasn't on purpose.

09:03.460 --> 09:05.850
He's dodging our attacks.

09:09.120 --> 09:11.600
How can we attack him?

09:11.600 --> 09:14.740
At this rate, we'll destroy the altar.

09:15.490 --> 09:16.900
I have to do it.

09:17.360 --> 09:22.310
Now that I've evolved,
I'm a different person.

09:25.540 --> 09:29.090
Water, stop the Lucasite's movements!

09:30.140 --> 09:31.170
Go!

09:47.910 --> 09:50.220
I did it! I caught him!

09:50.640 --> 09:51.440
Now!

09:51.870 --> 09:53.200
Leviatan...

09:53.910 --> 09:56.070
Okay, leave it to us!

09:56.070 --> 09:57.200
Fire!

10:00.970 --> 10:02.490
Go!

10:09.810 --> 10:11.170
Did we get him?

10:17.730 --> 10:19.350
S-Sorry...

10:19.350 --> 10:23.570
Oh, come on. There's no point if you
disperse the water with your fire magic!

10:24.180 --> 10:26.060
Huh? Bahamut?

10:27.370 --> 10:29.390
I'm beat.

10:29.390 --> 10:32.290
I used too much magic
in that last attack.

10:33.270 --> 10:35.320
Mu-chan, are you finished already?

10:35.720 --> 10:39.310
But without all of us, we can't...

10:52.520 --> 10:56.550
If only we had a sphere.
We could've summoned Fire Drake...

11:06.770 --> 11:09.490
Did I really evolve?

11:09.490 --> 11:11.810
Is this all evolving does?

11:12.470 --> 11:14.340
We can't win like this.

11:15.920 --> 11:17.510
I want to protect this place.

11:19.510 --> 11:21.410
I want the power to protect it!

11:56.170 --> 11:57.170
What?

12:05.620 --> 12:07.990
What is this feeling?

12:08.660 --> 12:10.000
Levi-tan...

12:10.750 --> 12:12.320
She's so cool...

12:12.320 --> 12:15.750
All right! Leviatan evolved!

12:29.790 --> 12:31.290
This is evolution...

12:32.310 --> 12:34.700
Water, obey me!

12:42.130 --> 12:44.290
Jörm, hit it as hard as you can!

12:44.290 --> 12:45.070
Got it!

12:56.960 --> 12:59.330
All right, we did it!

12:59.330 --> 13:00.590
We did it!

13:01.260 --> 13:02.840
We defeated it...

13:05.210 --> 13:08.200
Amazing, amazing! I'm moved!

13:08.200 --> 13:10.140
You're all amazing!

13:13.960 --> 13:16.820
But the barrier's gone.

13:21.010 --> 13:21.940
Huh?

13:22.510 --> 13:24.190
The barrier came back.

13:24.820 --> 13:27.280
I know! Let's go to Kero-chan's room!

13:28.220 --> 13:29.830
Heqet!

13:30.970 --> 13:33.410
Could something have happened to Heqet?

13:34.800 --> 13:35.770
Huh?

13:41.670 --> 13:44.210
Um, hello...

13:44.710 --> 13:45.700
Huh?

13:46.940 --> 13:48.140
Jörm?

13:48.140 --> 13:50.270
It's Jörm!

13:50.270 --> 13:52.140
Metal, Rudra, Ragon!

13:52.140 --> 13:54.060
What are you doing here?

13:54.060 --> 13:56.380
And you're covered in cuts and bruises.

13:56.380 --> 13:57.670
What happened?

13:58.230 --> 14:00.710
You never came back from your job,

13:58.230 --> 14:00.710
When we got here, the froggy was broken,

13:58.230 --> 14:00.710
There was a big castle on top of a mountain,

14:00.710 --> 14:04.030
so we've been looking for you.

14:00.710 --> 14:04.030
and we looked for water and food.

14:00.710 --> 14:04.030
and we fell in a hole and found a weird rock.

14:04.030 --> 14:08.070
Right, sorry. I can't understand
you when you all talk at once.

14:08.070 --> 14:10.280
We told you!

14:10.620 --> 14:13.500
You never came back from your job,

14:10.620 --> 14:13.500
When we got here, the froggy was broken,

14:10.620 --> 14:13.500
There was a big castle on top of a mountain,

14:13.500 --> 14:16.960
so we've been looking for you.

14:13.500 --> 14:16.960
and we looked for water and food.

14:13.500 --> 14:16.960
and we fell in a hole and found a weird rock.

14:16.960 --> 14:18.260
There was a froggy!

14:18.260 --> 14:19.770
The froggy was broken.

14:19.770 --> 14:21.960
But when we fixed him...

14:21.960 --> 14:24.050
...water came out!

14:26.040 --> 14:28.220
Allow me to explain.

14:28.740 --> 14:32.160
Shortly before you returned to this temple,

14:32.160 --> 14:34.530
these people arrived here.

14:35.000 --> 14:37.060
They found me where I had collapsed

14:37.060 --> 14:40.230
and went to find water in order to save me.

14:41.110 --> 14:44.770
Out of strength and unable
to keep up the barrier,

14:44.770 --> 14:48.240
just when I thought I was done for,

14:48.820 --> 14:51.990
these people brought me water.

14:53.100 --> 14:56.170
Thanks to them, I was able to recover.

14:57.610 --> 15:01.290
I see. That's why the
barrier came back.

15:01.290 --> 15:02.870
You're all so amazing.

15:03.920 --> 15:08.850
These people saved my life and the temple.

15:12.510 --> 15:16.950
You seem to have changed since
the last time I saw you.

15:18.890 --> 15:22.270
Something inside you has grown stronger.

15:24.390 --> 15:26.530
You did evolve, right?

15:26.530 --> 15:27.640
Really?

15:27.640 --> 15:29.280
That's right.

15:30.320 --> 15:32.620
Yes, very good, very good.

15:32.620 --> 15:36.540
You're the rising star
of the Aquafall Defense.

15:42.730 --> 15:46.780
We've defeated the Lucasite.
Restore yourself.

15:48.050 --> 15:52.580
It may take some time, but the
evil one has disappeared.

15:53.370 --> 15:55.760
The spring will be restored.

15:56.420 --> 15:58.770
I believe it will be.

15:59.650 --> 16:04.030
You have done much for me. Thank you.

16:04.380 --> 16:06.440
You don't need to thank us.

16:07.250 --> 16:13.260
You protected us, and more than
anything else, we loved this place.

16:13.760 --> 16:15.860
Kero-chan, what are you
going to do now—

16:16.440 --> 16:18.290
Sorry, nothing...

16:18.930 --> 16:21.150
What are you going to do now?

16:21.870 --> 16:25.920
I will continue protecting this temple.

16:26.510 --> 16:29.110
That is my destiny.

16:30.820 --> 16:31.800
I see.

16:34.030 --> 16:36.130
We'll come visit you again.

16:37.050 --> 16:39.120
I will be waiting for you.

16:39.770 --> 16:44.590
When you do return, you are welcome
to bring some fine gentlemen.

16:44.590 --> 16:45.970
As many as you can find.

16:51.960 --> 16:53.720
Goodbye, then.

16:53.720 --> 16:56.500
Bye bye! See you later!

17:02.580 --> 17:05.510
Jörm, what's all that luggage?

17:05.510 --> 17:07.420
This is Mu-chan's.

17:07.420 --> 17:09.690
Who's Mu-chan?

17:09.690 --> 17:11.550
That girl wearing the hat.

17:12.750 --> 17:15.120
Why aren't you carrying anything?

17:15.120 --> 17:16.540
Why, why?

17:17.770 --> 17:20.310
Because I'm the daughter
of an important man.

17:20.590 --> 17:24.660
Do the daughters of important men
make other people carry their luggage?

17:24.660 --> 17:27.520
Why don't you carry your own stuff?

17:27.680 --> 17:29.460
Why, why?

17:31.460 --> 17:32.570
I'll carry it!

17:32.740 --> 17:34.520
What? This is pretty heavy.

17:34.520 --> 17:35.810
It's fine.

17:35.810 --> 17:37.570
Okay, then.

17:42.360 --> 17:44.200
I told you it was heavy...

17:50.980 --> 17:52.580
What kind of game is this?

17:52.580 --> 17:53.960
How do you win?

17:55.870 --> 18:02.490
By the way, how did you know
Jörmungand was in those ruins?

18:02.490 --> 18:05.430
Now that you mention it,
yes. How did you know?

18:05.720 --> 18:08.440
A little boy told us.

18:08.810 --> 18:10.550
A boy?

18:11.200 --> 18:14.490
Thank you for defeating the Lucasite.

18:16.880 --> 18:18.090
He's not there...

18:19.120 --> 18:20.910
What was that?

18:21.750 --> 18:23.330
Hey, look.

20:11.620 --> 20:19.420
Next Episode

20:14.540 --> 20:19.420
It's Definitely a Shock!
